    <string name="info_guidelines_body">\u2022 List only items you own and can hand over.\n\u2022 Describe the condition honestly and show real photos.\n\u2022 No prohibited items: weapons, alcohol, medicine, exam answers.\n\u2022 Be respectful in chats. Harassment leads to a ban.\n\u2022 Keep every transaction inside the app.</string>
    <string name="info_safety_body">\u2022 Meet only at a Safe Meetup Point during office hours.\n\u2022 Check the item before you pay.\n\u2022 Pay in person; never send money ahead.\n\u2022 Bring a friend if you feel unsure.\n\u2022 Report anything suspicious from the listing or chat.</string>
    <string name="info_help_body">How do I reserve an item?\nOpen the listing and tap Reserve, then pick a meetup point, day and time.\n\nCan I cancel a reservation?\nYes. Open the listing and tap Cancel reservation on the reservation card.\n\nHow do I mark my item as sold?\nOpen your listing from Profile and tap Mark as sold.</string>
    <string name="info_about_body">Hold High The Shop is the campus marketplace for University of the Cordilleras students. Sell, rent or swap what you no longer need and give it a second life.\n\nVersion 1.0</string>
